# Cause: ariadne.buildOn(noBlocks) -> bpe.tokenStrings -> gpt-tokenizer decode([id]) per token through the library's
# module-global TextDecoder in streaming mode, never flushed (node_modules/gpt-tokenizer/esm/BytePairEncodingCore.js:6,203,216).
# The vocabulary scan (ariadne.vocabByScript, first renderBest of the process) leaves an incomplete UTF-8 sequence buffered;
# the next tokenStrings() gets "\uFFFD" prepended, segs.join('') !== chunk -> buildOn returns null -> the arm is skipped.
# bench/tmp/det4.ts: encode('≡') = [35726, 94]; decode([35726]) = "" (buffered), decode([94]) = "≡" (completed from the buffer).

## AFTER the fix (bpe.ts: flush around every public decode, once before/after the per-token walk):
